  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><em>此專案已停止更新。未來更新與新功能請前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-tinker-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-tinker-compat</a></em></strong></span></h1>\n<h1><strong>Epic Fight - Tinkers 護甲修復</strong></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-1.20.1-green?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Minecraft\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-47.x-red?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Forge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-20.0.0-orange?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Version\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-GPL--3-blue?style=flat-square\" alt=\"License\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>這個模組的作用是？</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>修復當 Epic Fight 戰鬥模式啟用時，Tinkers 護甲會錯誤顯示為鑽石護甲的 Bug。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>| <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1478309/description_b5d48f7c-843c-4593-8169-337547e49647.gif\" alt=\"back\"> |<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1478309/description_de169fbc-517e-4035-bab5-66b3e25a46b4.gif\" alt=\"front\"> |</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>它是如何運作的？</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Tinkers' Construct 護甲並非使用單一固定紋理；它會即時在玩家身體上動態層疊多個紋理。</li>\n<li>然而，Epic Fight 需要套用至自定戰鬥模型的靜態紋理。當它無法為 Tinkers' 護甲找到紋理時，就會預設使用原版鑽石護甲紋理。</li>\n<li>此模組透過「烘焙」所有 Tinkers' 個別圖層為一個完整紋理，並快取該紋理，於穿戴護甲時提供給 Epic Fight，以此解決問題。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>需要安裝的元件</strong></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct/files/7449219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1. Tinkers' Consturct</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle/files/7563777\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">2. Mantle</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/files/7633232\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3. Epic Fight</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>發現 Bug？請於 Issues 回報！</em></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
